      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "points": 10,
      "instruction": "W kazdym zdaniu znajduje sie luka. Wybierz jedyna poprawna odpowiedz sposrod czterech podanych.",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1.1",
          "stem": "There's no need to set the date for the meeting, I guess because we _________ each other in the gym anyway every weekend.",
          "options": [
            "A) will have seen",
            "B) have been seeing",
            "C) see",
            "D) will be seeing"
          ],
          "answer": "D"
        },
        {
          "id": "1.2",
          "stem": "If I were you I'd consult a/an _________ before trying to assemble those drawers.",
          "options": [
            "A) manual",
            "B) bulletin",
            "C) reference book",
            "D) index"
          ],
          "answer": "A"
        },
        {
          "id": "1.3",
          "stem": "You _________ about the accident by now, I assume.",
          "options": [
            "A) aren't going to read",
            "B) won't read",
            "C) won't have read",
            "D) won't be reading"
          ],
          "answer": "C"
        },
        {
          "id": "1.4",
          "stem": "When Jack _________ in primary school he _________ his maths homework which made his mum furious as she was a maths teacher there.",
          "options": [
            "A) has been / has been constantly forgetting",
            "B) had been / was constantly forgetting",
            "C) was / constantly forgot",
            "D) was / was constantly forgetting"
          ],
          "answer": "D"
        },
        {
          "id": "1.5",
          "stem": "I really wanted to pass this exam well so my teacher insisted that _________ me with preparing for it.",
          "options": [
            "A) she help",
            "B) she will help",
            "C) she helps",
            "D) she did help"
          ],
          "answer": "A"
        },
        {
          "id": "1.6",
          "stem": "When my pet rabbit died my older sister told me _________ sad and promised to get me a new one for my birthday.",
          "options": [
            "A) not be",
            "B) don't be",
            "C) to not be",
            "D) not to be"
          ],
          "answer": "D"
        },
        {
          "id": "1.7",
          "stem": "Mary was looking for the post office but didn't really know _________ she should ask.",
          "options": [
            "A) which",
            "B) whose",
            "C) who",
            "D) whom"
          ],
          "answer": "D"
        },
        {
          "id": "1.8",
          "stem": "Tony has been thoroughly _________ in astronomy since the field trip with his class.",
          "options": [
            "A) absorbed",
            "B) disappointed",
            "C) interested",
            "D) occupied"
          ],
          "answer": "A"
        },
        {
          "id": "1.9",
          "stem": "_________ happened!",
          "options": [
            "A) That we wanted",
            "B) What we wanted",
            "C) Which we wanted",
            "D) What did we want"
          ],
          "answer": "B"
        },
        {
          "id": "1.10",
          "stem": "_________ proper education is important.",
          "options": [
            "A) Whether a child gets",
            "B) Does a child get",
            "C) If a child gets",
            "D) Should a child get"
          ],
          "answer": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
